// The TV Tower's lightning down the rod's cable in frames (owner, 2026-10-25: «Проработай еще лучше опасности, раздели их красиво кадрам ассетов и
// анимируй»), path A off research/variants/tt-lightning-frames-2.png read on its own pixel grid (drawn at 7 image px a pixel, not 4: there its clamp is
// 6 x 6 and its cable 2 wide, as the game's; scratchpad hzt/gpx.py, cutlt.py): one clamp's period of the cable, its clamps whole as copies stack down the
// wall, the cable and clamps the same in every frame; idle A B (a faint grey spark under a clamp, the plain cable: the charge hopping copy to copy, 2 a
// second), warn C (the cable's edge glowing red, small sparks at the clamp), burn D E F (the bolt leaping out of the cable at a clamp and down to the next
